~ start
Rei: Greetings, Cupid. I take it that you brought the pastries? 
Cupid: Greetings, Princess Rei. Here they are as requested.

$> dialogue.start_item_requests()

if dialogue.all_correct_items():
	$> dialogue.record_tier_result(2)
	=> player_choice
elif dialogue.wrong_item_type():
	$> dialogue.record_tier_result(0)
	Rei: Are you making a mockery of me? You will be dealt with another time.

=> END

~ player_choice
- Baking is a difficult craft that very few people can get skilled at.
	Cupid: Baking is a difficult craft that very few people can get skilled at.
- Baked goods rise as CO2 from yeast is trapped and expands from the heat.
	$> dialogue.increase_tier_for_correct_choice()
	Cupid: Baked goods rise as CO2 from yeast is trapped and expands from the heat.
- Baking is a method of preparing food that uses moist heat.
	Cupid: Baking is a method of preparing food that uses moist heat.
Rei: Very good work, thank you. I wish you well.